## Why This Is Asked

Assesses end‑to‑end Azure data flow, tenant isolation, and basic DR/cost tradeoffs in a real‑world, privacy‑conscious context.

## Key Concepts

- Event Hubs as real‑time ingress
- PII redaction in a Function
- Cosmos DB partitioning by tenant
- Synapse analytics integration
- Power BI with Row‑Level Security
- BYOK encryption with Key Vault
- Simple cross‑region DR and cost levers

## Code Example

```javascript
module.exports = async function (context, event) {
  const redacted = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(event), (k, v) => {
    const keysToHide = ['email','phone','ssn','name'];
    if (typeof k === 'string' && keysToHide.includes(k.toLowerCase())) {
      return 'REDACTED';
    }
    return v;
  });
  context.bindings.cosmosDBItem = redacted;
  context.done();
};
```

